{% comment %}
MIRELLIS — Homepage Section 2
“The Problem We Are Solving”
Impact Theme Compatible
{% endcomment %}

<section class="mirellis-problem">
  <div class="mirellis-container">

    {% if section.settings.headline != blank %}
      <h2 class="mirellis-headline">
        {{ section.settings.headline }}
      </h2>
    {% endif %}

    {% if section.settings.subhead != blank %}
      <p class="mirellis-subhead">
        {{ section.settings.subhead }}
      </p>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="mirellis-body">
      {{ section.settings.body }}
    </div>

    {% if section.settings.insight != blank %}
      <div class="mirellis-insight">
        {{ section.settings.insight }}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if section.settings.closing != blank %}
      <p class="mirellis-closing">
        {{ section.settings.closing }}
      </p>
    {% endif %}

  </div>
</section>

<style>
/* =========================
   MIRELLIS — PROBLEM SECTION
   ========================= */

.mirellis-problem {
  background: #f6f1ea;
  padding: 120px 24px;
  position: relative;
}

.mirellis-container {
  max-width: 780px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

/* Headline */
.mirellis-headline {
  font-size: 42px;
  line-height: 1.15;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: #1c1c1c;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

/* Subhead */
.mirellis-subhead {
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: rgba(28, 28, 28, 0.7);
  margin-bottom: 48px;
}

/* Body text */
.mirellis-body {
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: rgba(28, 28, 28, 0.85);
}

.mirellis-body p {
  margin-bottom: 22px;
}

/* Insight block */
.mirellis-insight {
  margin-top: 48px;
  padding: 24px 0;
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: #1c1c1c;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

/* Closing line */
.mirellis-closing {
  margin-top: 48px;
  font-size: 16px;
  color: rgba(28, 28, 28, 0.65);
  font-style: italic;
}

/* Mobile */
@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
  .mirellis-problem {
    padding: 80px 20px;
  }

  .mirellis-headline {
    font-size: 30px;
  }

  .mirellis-subhead {
    font-size: 16px;
  }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Mirellis Problem",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "headline",
      "label": "Headline",
      "default": "Modern life rarely breaks. It only continues."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "subhead",
      "label": "Subhead",
      "default": "We move from one moment to another without true transition. The nervous system does not get time to reset — only to adapt."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Body Content",
      "default": "<p>Modern life does not feel chaotic because of what we do.</p><p>It feels chaotic because there are no longer clear beginnings and no longer clear endings.</p><p>The day starts with stimulation. And it continues without pause.</p><p>Work blends into consumption. Screens blend into rest. Evening blends into continuation.</p><p>Nothing signals that this is the end of a state.</p><p>So the body never fully exits what it is in.</p><p>Over time, this creates a quiet accumulation of fatigue, fragmentation, and rest that does not feel like recovery.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "insight",
      "label": "Insight Block",
      "default": "The nervous system does not struggle with activity. It struggles with lack of transition."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "closing",
      "label": "Closing Line",
      "default": "This is where Mirellis begins — not as a product, but as a response to something the modern world removed."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Mirellis Problem"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}